  dialogueLines:
  - Well... looks like we have a newcomer for the treasure.
  - 'Oh... you''re not here for the treasure? That''s rare. Let me tell you about
    it. '
  - 'This village has kept a secret about treasure in the desert for generations.
    This village has kept a secret about treasure in the desert for generations. '
  - 'Everyone here wants it... but everyone keeps talking rather than doing. '
  - 'Suddenly, snakes started attacking the village. '
  - 'Villagers are injured. Many have been sick for a long time. '
  - 'The soldiers noticed. They''re here to protect us now. '
  - 'They keep saying the snakes will leave one day... but it seems like it takes
    forever. '
  - 'I''m one of them... I kept saying ''tomorrow'' for years. Now tomorrow never
    came.  '
  - I see, but it seems impossible now...
  - I don't know why we kept delaying... I have told myself 'today is the day.' and
    'maybe tomorrow.' for many years...
  - Now the situation changed. We cannot go for the treasure as the snakes everywhere.
  - Well say... I don't think we got the time for this...
  - If the soldiers take it, they can... as our punishment for doing nothing.
  - If there is time, I would definitely act now.
  - Tell me, kid... What will you do now that you know this secret?
  - An honest answer... Glad to hear it.
  - I've spent years wondering why no one ever went. Fear? Excuses? Who knows?
  - But you seem different. You actually better than us. That's more than most of
    us ever did.
  - You're good to go, kid. Always remember... opportunities favor those who are
    prepared, and those who are brave enough to take the first step.
  typingSpeed: 0.05
  voiceSound: {fileID: 0}
  voicePitch: 1
